<title>CANADA: Talisman mails Wascana offer.</title>
<headline>Talisman mails Wascana offer.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talisman Energy Inc said on Tuesday it mailed its C$1.7 billion takeover offer for Wascana Energy Inc to the target's shareholders.</p>
<p>Talisman has offered C$18.50 cash or 0.41 of a Talisman share for each share of Regina-based Wascana.</p>
<p>Under the deal, 40 percent of Wascana stock would be bought for cash and the rest swapped for shares.</p>
<p>The offer was scheduled to expire at midnight on March 24, Talisman said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
